      "source_text": "──跑法如闪电般锐利，\n战绩彪炳而被誉为国内现役最强的选手，\n玉藻十字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e137796432975950f3177944b3f60b2d265137e61d1c400efe2bc7f7c9e1a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
